The '''2024–25 season''' was the 115th season in the history of '''[[Real Sociedad]]''', and the club's 15th consecutive season in [[La Liga]]. In addition to the [[2024–25 La Liga|domestic league]], the club participated in the [[2024–25 Copa del Rey|Copa del Rey]] and the [[2024–25 UEFA Europa League|UEFA Europa League]].

On 24 April 2025, head coach [[Imanol Alguacil]] confirmed that he would step down at the end of the season, concluding a spell of over six years in charge of the club.<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.realsociedad.eus/en/news/details/Imanol-will-not-continue-as-head-coach-next-season|title=Imanol will not continue as head coach next season|publisher=Real Sociedad|date=24 April 2025|access-date=24 April 2025}}</ref>

